    "仅支持 HTTP。预热后采样 3 次，至少成功 2 次；显示成功样本的中位数。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP only. After warm-up, take 3 samples; at least 2 must succeed. Shows the median of successful samples."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅支持 HTTP。预热后采样 3 次，至少成功 2 次；显示成功样本的中位数。"
